NOT A GOVERNMENT SERVICE

This is an independent prototype. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
connected to the National Disaster Management Authority, the India
Meteorological Department, the Central Water Commission, the National Disaster
Response Force, or any other government body. Those organisations are named in
this repository only as the publishers of guidance it cites and as the
institutions a production version would have to work with.

Every warning, shelter and measurement in this repository is synthetic. It
approves nothing, dispatches nothing and decides nothing. Do not deploy it as a
real warning system without the arrangements described in the "How this would
actually run" page.

In an emergency in India, call 112.
